-- ║                                                                          ║
-- ║ Part A: Adds User.hideReadingHistory boolean (PERF-06 privacy).         ║
-- ║ Part B: Converts AiAuditLog from heap to range-partitioned table        ║
-- ║         by month, with 60 partitions (2024-01 through 2028-12).         ║
-- ║         Follows the exact pattern from Phase 2 ReadingIndex migration.  ║
-- ║                                                                          ║
-- ║ Prisma continues to model AiAuditLog as a regular table — PG routes    ║
-- ║ inserts/selects transparently across partitions.                        ║
-- ║                                                                          ║
-- ║ DO NOT regenerate this migration.                                       ║
